sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Channel as Mobile/Web App
    participant WAF as WAF / DDoS Protection
    participant APIGW as API Gateway
    participant IAM as Customer IAM
    participant BFF as Digital API / BFF Layer
    participant Consent as Consent Service
    participant Context as AI Advisor Context Builder
    participant ODS as Read Models / ODS
    participant AI as AI Financial Advisor
    participant Audit as Audit / Compliance Store

    Customer->>Channel: Request financial advice
    Channel->>WAF: HTTPS request
    WAF->>APIGW: Forward allowed request
    APIGW->>IAM: Validate identity and session
    IAM-->>APIGW: Authorized customer context
    APIGW->>BFF: Route AI advice request
    BFF->>Consent: Check customer consent and eligibility
    Consent-->>BFF: Consent decision

    alt Consent missing or not allowed
        BFF-->>Channel: Ask customer for consent or reject request
    else Consent valid
        BFF->>Context: Build minimized customer context
        Context->>ODS: Read authorized summaries only
        ODS-->>Context: Minimized data view
        Context-->>BFF: AI-safe customer context
        BFF->>AI: Request advice with minimized context
        AI-->>BFF: Advice response
        BFF->>Audit: Record AI advice metadata and consent reference
        BFF-->>Channel: Show advice and disclaimer
    end
